  "update_count": 111,
  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nBy giving an extension a really long name it is possible to spoof and break various UI.  \n  \nWhen an extension starts debugging the browser, a message is shown that states \"x is debugging this browser\". By using a long extension name it is possible to spoof this message"
